      "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCMF 15-minute Binance windows\n\t\n\n1-minute USDT-M closes used to train CMF-2. The trainer cuts these into 15-minute windows (and a denser train stride) for BTC, ETH, SOL, and XRP.\n\n\t\n\t\t\nfile\nasset\n\n\n\t\t\nBTC_1m.npy\nBTCUSDT\n\n\nETH_1m.npy\nETHUSDT\n\n\nSOL_1m.npy\nSOLUSDT\n\n\nXRP_1m.npy\nXRPUSDT\n\n\n\t\n\nEach array is float64 closes from Binance futures fapi/v1/klines. Refresh locally with:\nuv run cmf fetch-data --days 45\n\nCompanion model: shubhxho/cmf-2Code: github.com/shubhxho/polymarket-model\n",
